  "body": "The owners have already bought, packed up and ready to move on, with one clear instruction - get it sold!\r\n\r\nThis 1 year old, single-level home combines contemporary style, generous space and exceptional versatility on a spacious 510sqm (approx.) section. Offering approx 197sqm of thoughtfully designed living, this impressive home features four bedrooms, three bathrooms and multiple living spaces, making it an ideal choice for growing families, extended households or buyers seeking extra flexibility.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen and dining area creates a welcoming hub for everyday family life and entertaining. The stylish kitchen is fitted with quality appliances and flows effortlessly onto a sun-soaked deck, perfect for morning coffee, weekend gatherings or relaxing in the afternoon sun. A separate lounge at the front of the home, complete with a fireplace, provides a cosy retreat for quiet evenings and family downtime.\r\n\r\nThe spacious master suite offers a private sanctuary, featuring a generous walk-in wardrobe, a stylish ensuite with a bathtub, and a dedicated study nook, ideal for working from home.\r\n\r\nWhat truly sets this home apart is its versatile, self-contained wing. Complete with its own bedroom, bathroom, living area, separate laundry and private entrance, it offers excellent flexibility for extended family, independent teenagers, visiting guests or potential home-stay accommodation.\r\n\r\nWith central air conditioning for year-round comfort, an internal-access double garage and additional storage, this home is designed to make everyday living effortless. Being just one year old, it offers the appeal of modern construction and contemporary design, backed by the balance of 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind.\r\n\r\nConveniently located just minutes from Silverdale Shopping Centre, quality schools, scenic walking trails and motorway access, you'll enjoy the perfect balance of peaceful surroundings and everyday convenience. \r\n\r\nThe vendor is highly motivated, and this could be your opportunity to secure a fantastic Millwater property at great value. Act now before it's too late. \r\n\r\nContact Tim 021 055 2650 today to arrange your private viewing or visit the next open home!",
